&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.9pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Utility plant accruals were $4 million and $6 million&amp;#160;at&amp;#160;December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. Amortization expense of intangible assets was insignificant at both December 31,&amp;#160;2025&amp;#160;and 2024. Estimated amortization expense for 2026 through 2030 is insignificant per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Gross additions to Utility Plant (less nuclear fuel) on the Statement of Cash Flows excludes $0.2 million and $(22) million as of December 31,&amp;#160;2025&amp;#160;and 2024, respectively, of significant non-cash transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;The total amount of AFUDC included in the Statement of Income was $1.7 million in 2025 (an equity component of $1.4 million and an interest expense component of $0.3 million) and $3.4 million in 2024 (an equity component of $3 million and an interest expense component of $0.4 million).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Depreciation is generally computed over the asset&amp;#8217;s estimated useful life using the straight-line method. The composite weighted-average depreciation rates were 2.43% for 2025 and 2.46% for 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
