&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;"&gt;Rental expense for operating leases classified in Net Utility Operating Income was $6 million in 2025 and $9 million in 2024, which is included in Operation Expenses on the Statement of Income.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 13.9pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;12. Subsequent Events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: 13.9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;We have evaluated&amp;#160;significant events&amp;#160;and transactions that occurred from January 1,&amp;#160;2026&amp;#160;through April 20, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued, and no&amp;#160;subsequent&amp;#160;events requiring disclosure were noted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
