  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="HHAEFD0C0B78312BCA6C32A13F3D36E172" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">Respondent is a natural gas company engaged in the business of transporting natural gas in interstate commerce subject to the jurisdiction of the Commission. The facilities operated by the Respondent consist of a pipeline sytem extending from an interconnection with the pipeline systems of Texas Eastern Transmission, LP at a point near Lambertville, New Jersey to a point near Boston, Massachusetts. Respondent's customers are various local distribution companies, natural gas marketers, industrial end-users, municipalities and electric generation facilities serving Connecticut, Massachusetts, New Jersey, New York, and Rhode Island.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
